              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khunyanga eyo, OMWAMI aboola, ndalafunaka likokolo nilirusia mumakosi kabwe, nikhalaka ebibohelo biabwe; kata abasuku shibalabakhalabania khandi ta; ",
          "type": "text",
